  "description": "Future Mag-M3 candidate: low-current single-axis micro-test. Target axis is selectable; default is X. This plan is NOT executable in Mag-M0.5. Shutdown uses verified_normal sequence: OUTP 0 → CURR 0 → SYST:LOC.",
  "axis_id": "mag_x",
  "profile_id": "maynuo_m8812_lab_xyz",
